ailure</strong> The creature is pulled 30 feet and knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is pulled 60 feet and knocked prone.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"jo3q05eQophOVHST","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Thundergrip","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The living lightning rod is charged and has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} in one of its fists</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The living lightning rod deals @Damage[(2d12+10)[electricity]] damage to the creature (@Check[fortitude|dc:36|basic]) and extends the duration of the grabbed or restrained condition until the end of the living lightning rod's next turn. The value of the Living Lightning Rod's charged condition reduces by 1.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"YND0mQKima3foIe4","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtu